OL,3,AMeta to pay up to $18bn to settle
OL,4,Aclaims its platforms harm children
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media giant Meta has agreed to a
OL,7,Fsignificant settlement with US states
OL,8,Fand territories to resolve claims that
OL,9,FFacebook and Instagram harmed children.
OL,11,FIf approved by a California judge, Meta
OL,12,Fwill pay a maximum of $18bn (#13.3bn)
OL,13,Fto 48 states, plus the District of
OL,14,FColumbia and three US territories,
OL,15,Fmarking the company's largest payment
OL,16,Fover child safety litigation to date.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
