OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787780896
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AMeta to pay up to $18bn to settle
OL,4,Aclaims its platforms harm children
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeta will also implement a host of
OL,7,Fchanges to the platforms aimed at
OL,8,Fbetter protecting children online,
OL,9,Fwhich the states had demanded,
OL,10,Fincluding default daily time limits and
OL,11,Fnight-time blocks.
OL,13,F"This is a major moment to clean up an
OL,14,Findustry that has been hurting our
OL,15,Fkids", California Attorney General Rob
OL,16,FBonta said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
