OL,3,AXbox boss 'thinking about
OL,4,Aaffordability' of next-gen console
OL,5,
OL,6,FXbox chief executive Asha Sharma says
OL,7,Fthe gaming giant needs to be "thinking
OL,8,Fabout" affordability for its
OL,9,Fnext-generation console, amid a
OL,10,F"crisis" in computing prices.
OL,12,FIn an interview with the BBC, she said
OL,13,Frising hardware costs partly driven by
OL,14,FAI spending mean firms need to find
OL,15,Fways to make gaming affordable.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787780896
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AXbox boss 'thinking about
OL,4,Aaffordability' of next-gen console
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe also revealed gamers will soon be
OL,7,Fable to get digital versions of many of
OL,8,Fthe physical games they currently own,
OL,9,Fpotentially meaning their old games can
OL,10,Fbe played on future Xbox consoles
OL,11,Fwithout having to put a disc in a
OL,12,Fdrive.
OL,14,F"I know players love physical media,
OL,15,Fand I know there's a lot of benefits in
OL,16,Fdigital media, and I want to make sure
OL,17,Fpeople have a choice," Sharma said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
