OL,3,A'Angel by my side' - Miley Cyrus pays
OL,4,Atribute to godmother Dolly Parton
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiley Cyrus, Taylor Swift, Beyonce, Sir
OL,7,FPaul McCartney and Sir Elton John have
OL,8,Fled an outpouring of tributes from
OL,9,Fcelebrities and fans to Dolly Parton
OL,10,Ffollowing the music icon's death at the
OL,11,Fage of 80.
OL,13,FCyrus paid an emotional tribute to her
OL,14,Fgodmother, "Aunt Dolly", describing her
OL,15,Fas an "angel by my side". "I will
OL,16,Falways love her and want to make her
OL,17,Fproud," she wrote on Instagram.
OL,19,FThe Tennessee-born singer died on
OL,20,FTuesday after "a brief battle with
OL,21,Fcancer", her team said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
